#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:5
#: 659dfa824a9b45c48cfb6784958a039e
msgid "Common Power Module"
msgstr "通用电源模块"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:11
#: 843f64003c0f49d08891748d25f02db6
msgid ""
"Many autopilots can be purchased with an analog power module that provides a"
" stable power supply to the autopilot and also supports measuring the "
"battery voltage and current consumption."
msgstr "许多飞控可配套购买模拟电源模块，为飞控提供稳定供电，同时支持监测电池电压和电流消耗。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:14
#: 4f4b3a73056c464ba36d1e2917648fac
msgid "Specifications"
msgstr "规格参数"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:16
#: 7179089d71424970b21eb49d0c84521e
msgid ""
"Below are typical limits, but it is best to confirm directly with the "
"vendor:"
msgstr "以下为典型限制值，具体请向供应商确认："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:18
#: 66a462fcb9284a2ca38e465098d0c3eb
msgid "Maximum input voltage of 18V (4S lipo)"
msgstr "最大输入电压 18V（4S 锂电池）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:19
#: 444cbb7cd6cb4e419a52691dd2b5f5a2
msgid "Maximum of 90 Amps (but only capable of measuring up to 60 Amps)"
msgstr "最大 90A（但仅能测量最大 60A）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:20
#: 967c9973516647af82b6fe22ec92a478
msgid "Provides 5.37V and 2.25Amp power supply to the autopilot"
msgstr "为飞控提供 5.37V、2.25A 的电源"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:24
#: ca2427c2119d49718cea32e3d94aedad
msgid ""
"The Power Module provides enough power for the autopilot, receiver, and a "
"few low powered peripherals (lidar, telemetry) but does not have enough "
"power for servos or high current devices like FPV transmitters or the RFD900"
" radios.  More information on :ref:`powering the Pixhawk can be found here "
"<common-powering-the-pixhawk>`"
msgstr ""
"电源模块可为飞控、接收机及少数低功耗外设（测距仪、数传）供电，但不足以为舵机或 FPV 发射机、RFD900 电台等高电流设备供电。更多信息请参阅 "
":ref:`powering the Pixhawk can be found here <common-powering-the-pixhawk>`"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:26
#: bbb8e67196234a1d9f3d2214041716bb
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Power Modules of this type (resistive shunt) cannot continuously support "
"their maximum rated current. Excessive and destructive heat can be generated"
" at continuous current levels exceeding 33% to 66% of the maximum rated "
"current (instantaneous rating). Check with manufacturer for ratings."
msgstr ""
"此类电源模块（阻性分流型）无法持续支持其额定最大电流。在超过额定最大电流（瞬时额定值）33%～66% "
"的持续电流下可能产生过多热量并造成损坏。请向制造商确认额定参数。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:29
#: 51f3d0d355ca4cc6b90b3959d79e1883
msgid "Connecting to the autopilot"
msgstr "连接至飞控"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:31
#: 6c88c3d082004e33b242cec7fa24b37f
msgid ""
"The 6 pin cable from the power module plugs into the POWER port of the "
"autopilot"
msgstr "电源模块的 6 针线缆插入飞控的 POWER 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:37
#: acd39e7b795a465ba0947caf2fc813dc
msgid ""
"The battery is connected to the power module's male connector.  The ESC or "
"Power Distribution Board should be connected to the power module's female "
"connector."
msgstr "电池连接至电源模块的公头连接器，ESC 或电源分配板连接至电源模块的母头连接器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:40
#: 6e1b4a821ec84f399bbb8268fb40f22a
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:42
#: 52fe4d8b5c6d4cac95d89168629020e6
msgid ""
"Most ground stations provide a battery monitor interface but the parameters "
"can also be set manually:"
msgstr "大多数地面站提供电池监测器界面，也可手动设置参数："

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:44
#: 6cabc4e265214a0685855cee27d32315
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = **3** to measure only voltage or **4** "
"to measure both voltage and current (you will need to reboot the board after"
" changing this)"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_MONITOR <BATT_MONITOR>` = **3** 仅测量电压，或 **4** "
"同时测量电压和电流（更改后需重启飞控板）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:45
#: 2e3cb312f0374df584e034c9b62a37cb
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = **2**. The "
"autopilot pin connected to the power module's voltage pin"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_PIN<BATT_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"**2**。连接至电源模块电压引脚的飞控引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:46
#: 99d41238ae984866a7fa934f8920439c
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` converts the "
"analog voltage received from the power module's voltage pin to the battery's"
" voltage"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_VOLT_MULT<BATT_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"将从电源模块电压引脚读取的模拟电压转换为电池电压"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:47
#: 25ba7f21b3f44e948ab0d11d03b43dd9
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = **3**. The "
"autopilot pin connected to the power module's current pin"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_CURR_PIN<BATT_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = "
"**3**。连接至电源模块电流引脚的飞控引脚"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:48
#: a1a622726f15447e98dbe8ce80e6b530
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` converts the "
"analog voltage received from the power module's current pin to the battery's"
" current"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_PERVLT<BATT_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"将从电源模块电流引脚读取的模拟电压转换为电池电流"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:49
#: 1103658b89334957a9a26d2cb261327e
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET <BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` voltage "
"offset received from the power module's current pin when ther is no current "
"being pulled from the battery"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT_AMP_OFFSET <BATT_AMP_OFFSET__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` "
"电池无电流时电源模块电流引脚的电压偏移量"

