"monitor-setup-on-ardupilot-copter-3-6/35441>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:55
#: 9cc5635ec0eb436dbcb5b4cd965edbd4
msgid "Dual Battery Monitoring"
msgstr "双电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:57
#: efda86a34f24404d8904c7d819d78a6b
msgid ""
"If the autopilot has additional analog-to-digital pins available, a second "
"battery can be monitored by setting up the ``BATT2_`` parameters.  The "
"values below allow reading a second battery's voltage and current using "
":ref:`The Cube's <common-thecube-overview>` POWER2 port."
msgstr ""
"如果飞控有额外的模数转换引脚，可通过设置 ``BATT2_`` 相关参数来监测第二块电池。以下参数值可通过 :ref:`The Cube "
"<common-thecube-overview>` 的 POWER2 接口读取第二块电池的电压和电流。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:59
#: eb6d917138e2475fbba03302a8434825
msgid ""
":ref:`BATT2_MONITOR <BATT2_MONITOR>` = **4** to measure both voltage and "
"current (you will need to reboot the board after changing this)"
msgstr ":ref:`BATT2_MONITOR <BATT2_MONITOR>` = **4** 同时测量电压和电流（更改后需重启飞控板）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:60
#: 84d49a5e145e4f2c869c59d7709a0db3
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_VOLT_PIN <BATT2_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = **13**"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT2_VOLT_PIN <BATT2_VOLT_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = **13**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:61
#: cab396af934845698b18a65a2bb676a9
msgid ":ref:`BATT2_CURR_PIN <BATT2_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = **14**"
msgstr ""
":ref:`BATT2_CURR_PIN <BATT2_CURR_PIN__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` = **14**"

#: ../../source/docs/common-3dr-power-module.rst:63
#: e8e07c68e4e34c6e9a13e3434cefef34
msgid ""
"The :ref:`BATT2_VOLT_MULT <BATT2_VOLT_MULT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` and "
":ref:`BATT2_AMP_PERVLT <BATT2_AMP_PERVLT__AP_BattMonitor_Analog>` should "
"also be set by comparing the reported values vs values collected using a "
